    "en": "Volunteer intake",
    "fr": "Accueil des bénévoles"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "Volunteer applications, screening and the shifts they sign up for.",
    "fr": "Les demandes de bénévolat, la vérification et les quarts auxquels les bénévoles s’inscrivent."
  },
